  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> multiply inches by <strong>2.54</strong> to get centimeters. 1&nbsp;inch = 2.54&nbsp;cm exactly, so 10&nbsp;in = 25.4&nbsp;cm and 12&nbsp;in (1&nbsp;ft) = 30.48&nbsp;cm.</p></div>

