  <section id="formula" aria-labelledby="formula-h">
    <h2 id="formula-h">Inches to cm Formula</h2>
    <p class="tp-note" style="font-size:17px!important"><span class="tp-kbd">cm = inches &times; 2.54</span></p><p>Since 1959 the inch has been defined as exactly 2.54&nbsp;centimeters, so the conversion is exact, not an approximation. Example: a 32&nbsp;inch waist is 32 &times; 2.54 = 81.28&nbsp;cm.</p>
  </section>

