  <section id="reverse" aria-labelledby="reverse-h">
    <h2 id="reverse-h">Converting cm Back to Inches</h2>
    <p>Divide centimeters by 2.54, or multiply by 0.3937. For example, 100&nbsp;cm &divide; 2.54 = 39.37&nbsp;in. For heights in centimeters, the <a href="/cm-to-feet-and-inches/">cm to feet and inches converter</a> gives feet and inches directly.</p>
  </section>

